{
  "id": "1CH.26",
  "number": "26",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Damanyoojiga 26",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Furiischoodiga gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba gisilachiida gadiyeeda furiischoodiga: fuga dooshta Gora, Meshelemiya gil orjeeda Gore, gea orjooga Asafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Meshelemiya gwandeawa orjooga; duweacheeda Sekariya, Yediya-eli deabiyeenya, Sebadiya deaba samwagu, Yatinieli deaba ang'wani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elamu deaba muudi, Yohana deaba lahi, Elioenayi deaba ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Obed-edomu gwandeawa orjooga; duweacheeda Shemaya, deabiyeenya Yehosabadi, deaba samwagu Yowa, deaba ang'wan Sakari, Netaneli deaba muudi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amieli deaba lahi, Isakari deaba ispwa, Beuletayi deaba sis, aba gideaba ghoadaw ASEETA ghawooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaji orjeedaanyi was Shemaya orjooga was fuga hees aba dooshinga ghweaniga nyaawa; aba gideaba headiga meanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Shemaya: Otni, ea Refaeli, ea Obedi, ea Elsabadi, nea orjooga ghaamwat ea meanyi, nea Elibu ea Semakiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu seaniin orjooga Obed-edomu; saawa sea orjooga nyaawa ea orjooga ghaamwat, was fuga meanyi ammu gwasin gadiyeeni; fuga Obed-edomu ea laadam ea iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Meshelemiya gwandeawa orjooga ea orjooga ghaamwat, was fuga meanyi, was fih damasis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara Hosa, bea orjooga Merari, gwandeawa orjooga; siida haw geeguura Shimri; (earapeadi mii duweacheeda gil, ghoadaw ghwaan hawunda;) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilkiya deaba iyeenya, Debaliya deaba samwagu, Sekariya deaba ang'wani; orjooga sean bea Hosa ea orjooga ghaamwat buuneesean ea damasamwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeedeaba sih ghwahidu galanda furiischoodiga, aba jeedeaba fiisu heesiin, aba gidabeada fuga gheanyaawa, ak gagadiiy aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gealoat aba giliwas gealga ghweaniga nyaawa gea manang'i ea gea hees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea loota heeda ghayeawa gaweesa Shelemiya. Ak gealoat eara orjeedaanyi siguura Sakariya, was siida bwaraawu bea fughareeda, ak gagal guuraydaanyi meatkweeda wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagal dea Obed-edomu wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, nea orjoagaaschi geataw gheeda siitiiwshacheewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba Shupimu ea Hosa geanyaawa gwardu nea gagal heeda biyeara, was ghuuta dooshta Shaleketi, mida naweeda diyeada. Ak gwayamuutooschi furiischoodiga damanda furiischooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meatkweeda ghayeawa gwanda fih lah bea Lawi, nea wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa goobiida fih ang'wan galeaga sean, nea gea gheeda siitiiwshacheewa gabadiina iyeenya iyeenya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heeda biyeara neekeewa meandiida gwanda furiischoodi ang'wan ghuuta naweeda nea gwanda iyeenya heeda meandiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gidasilajaadayda furiischoodiga; aba jeeda fuga Gora, ea orjooga Merari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gadiyoojiga suuk bea gheeda sibata ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda fuga Lawi, Ahiya goombal gheeda siitiiwshacheewa bea ASEETA, nea goombal haleanjeeda siikghaydiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ladani niny siyagi bea dooshta Gershoni, niny gheambaghweanda buuneeda mwaatkwa, nea jeenyaawa gwanda buweadeega orjeedaanyi siguura Yehieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Yehieli, Setamu, ea Yoeli was orjeeda ghaamwat, goombal haleanjeeda siitiiw bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gea fuga Amramu, gea Ishari, gea Hebroni, gea Usieli: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea Shebueli, orjeeda Gershomu, orjeeda Musa, siida ambal haleanjeeda sean siitiiwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea buweadeagaaschi: ghang'eada Eliyasari gwanda orjeedaanyi was Rehabiya, ea orjeedaanyi was Yeshaya, ea orjeedaanyi was Yoram, ea orjeedaanyi was Sikri, ea orjeedaanyi Shelomoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shelomoti sea buweadeagaaschi goombal haleanjeeda sean siitiiw was haleanjeeda sisach eataw Dawdi was sugoocheanda, ea fuga hees bea gealga ghweaniga nyaawa, ea fuga hees was sugoodiga ambal sagalamnyoojiga ea bughalajeega, ea fuga hees bea shirikara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba haleanjeeda siyaas aba ng'ucheeda, geasach mwaatkwa ghaghaydiit, ak geadeasa gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea haleanjeeda ghayi sach Samweleeda deaha ng'asheega, ea Sawli orjeeda Gishi, ea Abneri orjeeda Neri, ea Yoabu orjeeda Seruya; ea siida wassean ghayi sach gida wassean nea ghaghaydiit, gwanda geatinga Shelomoti ea buweadeagaaschi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gadiyoojispa fih suuk bea Lawi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda fuga Ishari, ea fuga Genani ea orjooga nyaawa geataw gadiyoojiga jarooda bea fuga Israeli, ghoah sugoodiga ea fuga laja girgweaguutka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba fuga dooshta Hebroni, Hashabiya sea buweadeagaaschi fih sagalama ea bughalaji ispwa majeekcheewi, ghoahaaghwa fuga Israeli mida giigheawda Yordani duukusa heeda biyeara; aba gadiyoojiga sean bea NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gwasin gadiyeeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba fuga dooshta Hebroni gealoat Yeriya ghoah siida haw, aba heedeaba fiisu bea Hebronin aba jeacheenga nyaawa ea dooshinga ghweaniga nyaawa. (Aba gweaydeaba haradam bea sugoocheanduumeeda Dawdi ghang'eat gasiischooda ak geanyasa jeenyaawa fuga mideawa uurjeenga hees ak ea meanyi geanyasa Yaseri mida Gileyadi). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
