        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaloat Dawdi Yeriya sea buweadeagaaschi, fih sagalamnyooji iyeenya ea bughalaji ispwa mideawa uurjeenga, was fuga hees aba gealga ghweaniga nyaawa, jea ghoahaaghwa fuga dooshta Rubeni, ea gea Gadi, ea fuga mwaatkwa bea Manase aba giliwas gil deaschi sea ASEETA ea haleanjeeda gal sugoocheanda.",
